            "shortMessage": "[Fiber] Warn for Conditional Use of use() Based on Cache (#37104)",
            "shortMessageMarkdown": null,
            "shortMessageMarkdownLink": "<a data-pjax=\"true\" title=\"[Fiber] Warn for Conditional Use of use() Based on Cache (#37104)\n\nThis is a cherry-pick of https://github.com/react/react/pull/34030, with\na feature flag gating and a test coverage.\n\nThe flag is disabled by default and dynamic for FB builds to understand\nfirst how noisy this warning can be.\n\n---\n\nSee https://github.com/react/react/pull/34030 for more context on the\nchange.\" class=\"color-fg-default\" href=\"/react/react/commit/cbb046ab92b66dfc4ad1e1ea30d4b8beae6f2c24\">[Fiber] Warn for Conditional Use of use() Based on Cache (</a><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4958876326\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/react/react/issues/37104\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/react/react/pull/37104/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/react/react/pull/37104\">#37104</a><a data-pjax=\"true\" title=\"[Fiber] Warn for Conditional Use of use() Based on Cache (#37104)\n\nThis is a cherry-pick of https://github.com/react/react/pull/34030, with\na feature flag gating and a test coverage.\n\nThe flag is disabled by default and dynamic for FB builds to understand\nfirst how noisy this warning can be.\n\n---\n\nSee https://github.com/react/react/pull/34030 for more context on the\nchange.\" class=\"color-fg-default\" href=\"/react/react/commit/cbb046ab92b66dfc4ad1e1ea30d4b8beae6f2c24\">)</a>",
            "bodyMessageHtml": "This is a cherry-pick of <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3271748862\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/react/react/issues/34030\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/react/react/pull/34030/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/react/react/pull/34030\">#34030</a>, with\na feature flag gating and a test coverage.\n\nThe flag is disabled by default and dynamic for FB builds to understand\nfirst how noisy this warning can be.\n\n---\n\nSee <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3271748862\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/react/react/issues/34030\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/react/react/pull/34030/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/react/react/pull/34030\">#34030</a> for more context on the\nchange.",
