            "shortMessage": "[DevTools] Remove FlowFixMe from extension lifecycle (#37152)",
            "shortMessageMarkdown": null,
            "shortMessageMarkdownLink": "<a data-pjax=\"true\" title=\"[DevTools] Remove FlowFixMe from extension lifecycle (#37152)\n\nI've been triaging some lifecycle races during sessions with BFCache\ninvolved and noticed a few type errors in real world scenario. These\nobjects were not properly typed, fixing in this PR.\" class=\"color-fg-default\" href=\"/react/react/commit/c56a44903f91d41dce51107f34491daabdcb6a70\">[DevTools] Remove FlowFixMe from extension lifecycle (</a><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5020463462\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/react/react/issues/37152\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/react/react/pull/37152/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/react/react/pull/37152\">#37152</a><a data-pjax=\"true\" title=\"[DevTools] Remove FlowFixMe from extension lifecycle (#37152)\n\nI've been triaging some lifecycle races during sessions with BFCache\ninvolved and noticed a few type errors in real world scenario. These\nobjects were not properly typed, fixing in this PR.\" class=\"color-fg-default\" href=\"/react/react/commit/c56a44903f91d41dce51107f34491daabdcb6a70\">)</a>",
            "bodyMessageHtml": "I've been triaging some lifecycle races during sessions with BFCache\ninvolved and noticed a few type errors in real world scenario. These\nobjects were not properly typed, fixing in this PR.",
